| Speed: the hd clip without checksums (-t), changing one thing at a time:
| the number of output buffers (3, 4, 6), the way pictures are copied out
| (LDM 4 words, LDM 8 words, NEON - which only works from a pool), and
| where they arrive (PCI memory, a cacheable Physical Memory Pool, an
| uncachable one); each memory with the copy on its own timed each way
| (-K). Reports to ResultT.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 16384K -max 16384K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultT
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -K -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -B 4 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -B 6 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -c ldm8 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -m pmp -c neon -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -m pmp -K -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -m pmpu -K -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -m pmp -c neon -B 6 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
